## Summary

✅ **DO:**
- Use pure functions for calculations
- Use Signals for reactive financial models
- Handle floating point precision
- Test all financial calculations
- Format values for display
- Use TypeScript for type safety

❌ **DON'T:**
- Use React hooks (useState, useMemo)
- Ignore floating point errors
- Skip unit tests
- Use `any` types
- Forget to round values
